msgid "Office ladder · this month's rating"
msgstr "Ofis reytingi · shu oy uchun"

msgid "Your record"
msgstr "Sizning hisobingiz"

#, c-sharp-format
msgid "{0}: won {1}, lost {2}, drawn {3}"
msgstr "{0}: {1} ta g'alaba, {2} ta mag'lubiyat, {3} ta durang"

#, c-sharp-format
msgid "Office ladder: {0} this month, after {1} board games against co-workers"
msgstr "Ofis reytingi: shu oyda {0}, hamkasblar bilan {1} ta stol o'yinidan keyin"

msgid "Office ladder: play a board game against a co-worker this month to get a rating"
msgstr "Ofis reytingi: reyting olish uchun shu oyda hamkasb bilan stol o'yini o'ynang"

msgid "Playing Desk Arcade while it builds"
msgstr "Yig'ilish ketayotganda Desk Arcade o'ynayapman"

msgid "Desk Arcade · games on your desktop while it builds"
msgstr "Desk Arcade · yig'ilish ketayotganda ish stolida o'yinlar"

#, c-sharp-format
msgid "Desk Arcade daily · {0}: {1} ✓"
msgstr "Desk Arcade kunlik vazifasi · {0}: {1} ✓"

msgid "Copied · paste it into Teams, Slack or Telegram"
msgstr "Nusxalandi · Teams, Slack yoki Telegramga joylang"

msgid "Picture copied · paste it into a chat"
msgstr "Rasm nusxalandi · uni chatga joylang"

#, c-sharp-format
msgid "also saved as {0}"
msgstr "shuningdek saqlandi: {0}"

msgid "Couldn't copy the picture"
msgstr "Rasmni nusxalab bo'lmadi"

#, c-sharp-format
msgid "{0} of {1}"
msgstr "{0} / {1}"

msgid "Back"
msgstr "Orqaga"

msgid "Let's play"
msgstr "O'ynaymiz!"

msgid "Clicks go through"
msgstr "Bosishlar o'tib ketadi"

msgid "Only the game and the scoreboard take the mouse. Everywhere else your clicks and typing go to your windows, as if Desk Arcade were not there."
msgstr "Sichqonchani faqat o'yin va hisob taxtasi ushlaydi. Boshqa hamma joyda bosishlar va yozuvlar oynalaringizga boradi, go'yo Desk Arcade yo'qdek."

msgid "Window tops are platforms: balls, bugs and the pet land on them and ride along when you drag a window."
msgstr "Oynalarning yuqori qirrasi — platforma: to'plar, qo'ng'izlar va uy hayvoni ularga qo'nadi va oynani sudraganingizda birga ketadi."

msgid "Everything is in two menus"
msgstr "Hammasi ikki menyuda"

msgid "Right-click the tray icon, or click ☰ on the scoreboard: games, the pet, At work, themes, and playing with co-workers."
msgstr "Tray belgisini o'ng tugma bilan bosing yoki hisob taxtasidagi ☰ ni bosing: o'yinlar, uy hayvoni, «Ishda», mavzular va hamkasblar bilan o'yin."

#, c-sharp-format
msgid "{0} shows or hides the overlay · {1} next game · {2} brings the ball to the cursor"
msgstr "{0} ko'rsatish yoki yashirish · {1} keyingi o'yin · {2} to'pni kursorga keltirish"

msgid "Play while it builds"
msgstr "Yig'ilish ketayotganda o'ynang"

msgid "Put arcade in front of a command (arcade dotnet test) and the scoreboard shows it running, then chimes when it passes or fails."
msgstr "Buyruq oldiga arcade qo'ying (arcade dotnet test): hisob taxtasi uning ishlayotganini ko'rsatadi va u o'tganda yoki xato bilan tugaganda jiringlaydi."

msgid "Connect Claude Code and other coding agents under Coding agents & CI, and it tells you when they are done or need you."
msgstr "Claude Code va boshqa agentlarni «Agentlar va CI» bo'limida ulang — hisob taxtasi ular tugatganda yoki sizni kutayotganda aytadi."

msgid "Desk Arcade"
msgstr "Desk Arcade"

msgid "Close"
msgstr "Yopish"

msgid "Save as a picture"
msgstr "Rasm qilib saqlash"

